    },
    "Leash joins your tailnet on its own, without the system VPN, so it works while another VPN is on. Only the connection to the bridge uses it, and only while Leash is running. Create an auth key in the Tailscale admin console, and use the bridge's Tailscale IP or MagicDNS name as its address." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leash 自己加入你的 tailnet，不占用系统 VPN，所以在别的 VPN 开着时也能用。只有连接 bridge 的流量走它，而且只在 Leash 运行时。请在 Tailscale 管理后台创建 auth key，并把 bridge 的 Tailscale IP 或 MagicDNS 名称填作地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leash leaves the tailnet and deletes its saved key. Turning this back on needs a new auth key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leash 会退出 tailnet 并删除已保存的 key。重新开启需要新的 auth key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
