    "8787" : {

    },
    "A conversation you start here shows on the Lock Screen, in the Dynamic Island and on Apple Watch while the agent works. With Update in Background on, Leash keeps running until the turn ends (it plays silence, which uses some battery); otherwise it updates only while Leash is open and says when it may be out of date. The watch app reaches the bridge through this iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从这台 iPhone 发起的对话在 agent 工作时会显示在锁定屏幕、灵动岛和 Apple Watch 上。打开“后台更新”后，拴绳会在后台一直运行到这一轮结束（靠播放无声音频，会多耗一些电）；关闭时只在拴绳打开期间更新，可能过时时会标明。手表 App 通过这台 iPhone 连接 Bridge。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
